## Notes
- Switching from ImageMagick to PIL solved rendering issues for Indian scripts.
- Indic-OCR was effective for early-stage script evaluation.
- EasyOCR performed well but lacked fine control compared to custom models.
- Categorizing noise types improved experimental clarity.
- Realistic augmentations (e.g., blur, shadows, rotations) are essential for OCR robustness.
